<a href="#ubuntu"><img src="images/logo_ubuntu.png" alt="Ubuntu" id="ubuntu">
<strong>Ubuntu</strong> / Debian / Mint</a>
<p>launch a terminal and type <span class="textebleu">sudo apt-get install iperf3</span></p>
<br>

<a href="#fedora"><img src="images/logo_fedora.png" alt="Fedora" id="fedora">
<strong>Fedora</strong> / Red Hat / CentOS / Rocky</a>
<p>launch a terminal and type <span class="textebleu">yum install iperf3</span></p>
<br>

<a href="#freebsd"><img src="images/logo_freebsd.png" alt="FreeBSD" id="freebsd">
<strong>FreeBSD</strong></a>
<p>launch a terminal and type <span class="textebleu">sudo pkg install benchmarks/iperf3</span></p>
<br>

